# VortexSales mobile (`vorex mibile`)

This repo is **Flutter + Dart only**. Never add Next.js, Node.js, React, or web-app code here. AMREKA2 is the web server; this app is the phone client.

## Scope

- Work only in Flutter widgets and app structure: models, screens, services.
- Visual identity must match AMREKA2 1:1: ink/mist/cyan `#22E3D2` / violet `#8B6CFF`, glass, aurora, Outfit / Plus Jakarta / IBM Plex Sans Arabic.

## Services and AI

- Call the web server over HTTP using `VxApiConfig.baseUrl` + AMREKA2 paths (`/api/health`, `/api/chat`, `/api/catalog`, …).
- Pass the base URL at build time: `--dart-define=VX_API_BASE=https://…`
- **Never** put API keys, AI secrets, or `.env` credentials in this project. Keys stay on the web server.

```dart
// BAD — secrets in the app
const key = 'sk-...';

// GOOD — public base URL only
const base = String.fromEnvironment('VX_API_BASE');
final res = await http.get(Uri.parse('$base/api/health'));
```
